{"id":"cf87d058f11f59eb295babf9670a294059234d2a","url":"https://www.businessinsider.com/math-ai-mathematicians-careers-jobs-future-mit-2026-11","title":"Young mathematicians are reconsidering their careers: 'None of the individual work will matter'","site_name":"Buzzing","source":"www.businessinsider.com","byline":"Truman Dickerson","excerpt":"As AI remakes the field of math, some students say they feel like giving up.","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><section data-content-container=\"\" role=\"main\">\n\n    \n      \n    \n      <div data-load-strategy=\"disable-lazy\" data-component-type=\"post-top\" data-e2e-name=\"post-top\">\n    \n            \n            \n          \n            \n            \n            \n            \n              <div data-e2e-name=\"post-byline\" data-component-type=\"post-byline\" data-track-marfeel=\"post-byline\">\n                        <p><span>By</span>\n                                \n                                \n                                \n                                  <span data-e2e-name=\"Truman Dickerson\">\n                                \n                                    <span>\n                                      <a data-e2e-name=\"byline-author-name\" href=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/author/truman-dickerson\">Truman Dickerson</a>        \n                                  <span data-disable-for-sooth-user=\"\" data-component-type=\"follow-button\" data-load-strategy=\"lazy\" role=\"tooltip\" data-tooltip-position=\"middle\" data-tooltip-active=\"false\" data-state=\"\" data-topic-type=\"author\" data-topic-slug=\"truman-dickerson\" data-topic-link=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/author/truman-dickerson\" data-topic-label=\"Truman Dickerson\" data-topic-location=\"byline\" data-topic-shortened-label=\"Truman\" data-topic-image=\"{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;6a7252cb3f00ff875d13cb15&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;contentType&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;description&quot;:&quot;Truman Dickerson's picture&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1206,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Truman Dickerson&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:1206},&quot;links&quot;:{&quot;self&quot;:&quot;https://i.insider.com/6a7252cb3f00ff875d13cb15&quot;}}\">\n                                    \n                                  \n                                    <div>\n                                      <p>\n                                          You're currently following this author!\n                                   Click to unsubscribe from email alerts.\n                                      </p>\n                                    </div>\n                                    \n                                  </span>\n                                    </span>\n                                  </span>  </p>\n                      </div>\n        </div>\n\n  <section>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n      <section id=\"post-body\" data-component-type=\"post-body\" data-load-strategy=\"exclude\" data-lock-content=\"\">\n            \n            \n            \n              <div data-e2e-name=\"post-hero\" data-component-type=\"post-hero\" data-load-strategy=\"exclude\">\n                    <figure data-type=\"img\" data-e2e-name=\"image-figure-image\" data-media-container=\"image\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ImageObject\">\n                        <div>\n                          <meta itemprop=\"contentUrl\" content=\"https://i.insider.com/6ae203bb3ae265b597b02f23?width=1200\">\n                          <p><img src=\"https://i.insider.com/6ae203bb3ae265b597b02f23?width=700\" srcset=\"https://i.insider.com/6ae203bb3ae265b597b02f23?width=400&format=jpeg&auto=webp 400w, https://i.insider.com/6ae203bb3ae265b597b02f23?width=500&format=jpeg&auto=webp 500w, https://i.insider.com/6ae203bb3ae265b597b02f23?width=700&format=jpeg&auto=webp 700w, https://i.insider.com/6ae203bb3ae265b597b02f23?width=1000&format=jpeg&auto=webp 1000w, https://i.insider.com/6ae203bb3ae265b597b02f23?width=1300&format=jpeg&auto=webp 1300w, https://i.insider.com/6ae203bb3ae265b597b02f23?width=2000&format=jpeg&auto=webp 2000w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 900px\" alt=\"An illustration of a robot using an abacus.\" decoding=\"sync\">\n                        </p></div>\n                    \n                          <span>\n                              <span>\n                                \n                                <label for=\"caption-drawer-btn\">\n                                          </label>\n                        \n                            <figcaption data-e2e-name=\"image-caption\">\n                              <span>Graduate students studying math are considering leaving their careers because of AI.</span>\n                              <span>\n                                <span data-e2e-name=\"image-source\" itemprop=\"creditText\">Malte Mueller/Getty Images</span>      </span>\n                            </figcaption>\n                          </span>\n                        </span>\n                        \n                    </figure>\n              </div>\n    \n    \n    \n          \n    \n            \n    \n    \n          \n    \n            \n            \n            \n            \n    \n          \n    \n      <section data-load-strategy=\"lazy\" data-component-type=\"image-modal\" data-track-content=\"\" data-post-type=\"story\" data-track-marfeel=\"post-body-content\">\n                \n                    <p>Frontier AI programs can now do math <a target=\"_self\" href=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/cornell-professor-steven-strogatz-mathematicians-need-rizz-ai-era-2026-10\" data-track-click=\"{&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;body_link&quot;,&quot;event&quot;:&quot;tout_click&quot;,&quot;index&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;product_field&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;}\" rel=\"\">better than graduate students</a>.</p><p>Those students, it turns out, aren't taking the news well.</p><p>In a <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2610.40584\" data-track-click=\"{&quot;click_type&quot;:&quot;other&quot;,&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;body_link&quot;,&quot;event&quot;:&quot;outbound_click&quot;}\" rel=\" nofollow\">paper</a> published this week, researchers at MIT found that a vast majority of grad students and postdoctoral scholars they polled see their career prospects rapidly dimming as AI remakes the field.</p><p>Nearly 76% said they are increasingly unlikely to stay in academic math after earning their degrees. 76% said they feel less motivated to do research \"as a result of <a target=\"_self\" href=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/math-ai-tools-openai-terence-tao-ucla-2026-10\" data-track-click=\"{&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;body_link&quot;,&quot;event&quot;:&quot;tout_click&quot;,&quot;index&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;product_field&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;}\" rel=\"\">AI developments</a>.\"</p><p>And in a free-response portion of the survey, grad students laid bare their raw, pent-up feelings about the subject.</p><p>Perhaps most striking is a red-hot frustration with academic leadership, which respondents described as alternatively wayward, useless, meek, silent, and ineffectual.</p><p>\"It'd be great if institutes gave guidance instead of platitudes on this subject,\" one respondent wrote.</p><p>\"We are lacking high-level leadership from across the academic community,\" another said.</p><p>For the survey, conducted by three MIT-affiliated math students, the researchers polled 268 early-career mathematicians via a Google Form. Questions were multiple-choice and free response. They all centered on AI's ever-expanding ability to do work they've spent years studying.</p>\n                  \n                \n                  \n                <p>Notably, the response window closed just after OpenAI released <a target=\"_self\" href=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/openais-math-dump-rattles-math-researchers-saw-programs-wiped-out-2026-10\" data-track-click=\"{&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;body_link&quot;,&quot;event&quot;:&quot;tout_click&quot;,&quot;index&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;product_field&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;}\" rel=\"\">hundreds of solutions</a> to long-standing problems on October 6. The authors caveated the survey, saying it represents the vibe at \"only a small window of time.\"</p><p>\"The past couple of months have been exhausting,\" the researchers wrote. \"We're being forced to reckon with existential questions about a field we love, all while incredibly uncertain about our own futures.\"</p><p>Since OpenAI first really broke onto the mathematics scene in September, when it published solutions to the Navier-Stokes Millennium Prize question, the AI-generated solutions have only kept coming.</p><p>Mathematicians have described <a target=\"_self\" href=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/sam-altman-openai-mathematicians-math-disruption-navier-stokes-2026-10\" data-track-click=\"{&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;body_link&quot;,&quot;event&quot;:&quot;tout_click&quot;,&quot;index&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;product_field&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;}\" rel=\"\">going through stages</a> of disbelief, shock, denial, anger, and, for some, acceptance.</p><p>Though some high-level mathematical councils have convened to issue edicts on how AI should be used, it's not like OpenAI has to listen to them.</p><p>OpenAI and Anthropic have, however, made some concessions to the math community. Both AI giants pledged a combined $15 million to a foundation to support mathematicians, and OpenAI established an \"advisory group\" to judge its math operation.</p><p>If you ask students, though, the concessions haven't changed much for them.</p><p>\"It is difficult to do research and go to seminars when it feels like none of the individual work will matter much in the future,\" one respondent wrote.</p>\n                \n                \n                </section>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n      </section>\n\n    \n    <!-- Included desktop \"post-aside\" -->    \n\n    \n      \n      <section data-component-type=\"post-bottom\" data-load-strategy=\"exclude\" data-track-marfeel=\"post-bottom\">\n        <section>\n    \n    \n            \n            \n    \n            \n            \n            <section data-component-type=\"read-next\" data-e2e-name=\"read-next\" data-display-size=\"4\" data-post-id=\"6ae6416b7a0ec5bc41570b3e\" data-root-margin=\"250px 0px\" data-track-view=\"{&quot;subscription_experience&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;product_field&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;end_of_article_recirc&quot;}\">\n              <h2>Read next</h2>\n            \n              <div data-track-click-shared=\"{&quot;product_field&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;event&quot;:&quot;tout_click&quot;,&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;end_of_article_recirc&quot;,&quot;click_text&quot;:&quot;Read next&quot;}\" data-recommendations-content=\"\" data-e2e-name=\"read-next-list\" data-recommendations-list=\"\">\n                    \n                    \n                    \n                    <article data-component-type=\"tout\" data-load-strategy=\"exclude\" data-post-id=\"post\">\n                     \n                          \n                            <span>    <p><img data-src=\"/public/assets/logos/placeholder.png\" data-old-src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 1 1'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" src=\"/public/assets/logos/placeholder.png\" alt=\"\">\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            </p>  </span>\n                          \n                    \n                    \n                          <h3>\n           